Description: GH-23779: a ZipArchive destroyed without close() while its progress or cancel callback ran nested zip_close() and freed the archive in use (a use-after-free); no new stream while closing, no callback destructors after the engine shutdown (PHP 8.4.28, not in this branch); its tests taken
Origin: php-src commit 303e6aa82f2834a3c0d49a23824611d88f1e88c3 (jvoisin, 19.09.2026, PHP 8.4.28)

